; Optional: start the game with your real-world weather (Open-Meteo, free, no API key).
; Copy this file to weather.ini (next to game.exe) and fill in ONE of the options below.
; Without weather.ini the game still starts in the season and time of day from your PC clock.

city=Denver

; or use coordinates instead of a city name:
; latitude=39.74
; longitude=-104.99
